  "problem": "Consider a linear transformation $T$ that maps ${R}^{2}$ to the origin. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $\\text{rank}(T)=1$,  where $T$ is the standard matrix of $T$\n\nII. $\\text{Im}(T)$ contains no vectors of ${R}^{2}$\n\nIII. $\\text{Ker}(T)={R}^{2}$",
